          "distinct": true,
          "id": "c072f7e799d91f52907695211a3e43f7d889dc8c",
          "message": "feat(web): add blocklists management page\n\nIntroduce the blocklists dashboard view with actions for reloading,\nenabling/disabling, and URL reachability checks.\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User\n    participant UI as BlocklistsPage\n    participant Hook as useBlocklists\n    participant API as /api/blocklist\n\n    User->>UI: Navigate to /blocklists\n    UI->>Hook: fetchBlocklists()\n    Hook->>API: GET /api/blocklist/status\n    API-->>Hook: BlocklistStatus data\n    Hook-->>UI: Render blocklists table\n    User->>UI: Toggle Active / Click Reload\n    UI->>API: POST /api/blocklist/{action}\n    API-->>UI: Updated BlocklistStatus\n```",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-01T18:10:54+01:00",
          "tree_id": "8113e632d27f02fcc568e7cf0709738a976a6b44",
          "url": "https://github.com/rm-hull/dot-block/commit/c072f7e799d91f52907695211a3e43f7d889dc8c"
