          "id": "ccc507e9f0ee07783bd072ea2fab09c3d284c672",
          "message": "test(http): fix data race in SSE handler tests\n\nPrevent concurrent read/write data races on `httptest.ResponseRecorder`\nby reading the response body only *after* the handler has finished\nexecution and shut down completely.",
